This is an unofficial community PyTorch reproduction. It is not an official
Calico Life Sciences LLC release and is not endorsed by the Shorkie authors.

The architecture and training contract are derived from the Apache-2.0
Shorkie and Baskerville-yeast projects:
  https://github.com/calico/shorkie-paper

Shorkie paper and original authors:
  Kuan-Hao Chao, Majed M. Magzoub, Emily H. Stoops, Sean R. Hackett,
  Johannes Linder, and David R. Kelley.
  https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.09.19.677475

The PyTorch implementation contains substantial independent translation,
testing, packaging, and release-safety changes. Modified files are identified
by repository history and provenance documentation.

No upstream logo or trademark is included. The Shorkie name is used only to
describe compatibility and scientific provenance.
